      "description": "Waxed cotton earns its character. This one uses a dry-finish wax — less tacky than traditional oilcloth, so it will not mark a car seat, but it still beads water and takes on a patina at the elbows and cuffs within a season.\n\nFour bellows pockets across the front, a corduroy collar that can be turned up against wind, and a two-way zip under a storm placket so you can open the hem while cycling or riding.",
      "details": [
