      "description": "Cashmere is graded on fibre length and diameter. We buy Grade-A only — fibres above 34mm and under 16.5 microns — because shorter fibres are what pill after a month. Spun two-ply for durability and knitted at a 12-gauge, which gives a sweater that holds its shape without feeling heavy.\n\nFully fashioned, meaning each panel is knitted to shape and linked by hand rather than cut from a sheet. It costs more and wastes almost nothing.",
